                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "87b84582-55fa-331a-a7dd-fa7f541286a0",
                        "entry_id": "6837eea9-91fc-38af-a9b0-95dc911844e0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "спорт. играть нечестно, допускать фол, нарушать правила"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4020bac8-9ec9-4f7f-b9ad-11bd49484144",
                                "sense_id": "87b84582-55fa-331a-a7dd-fa7f541286a0",
                                "text": "В одном из первых же игровых эпизодов Зинедин фолит, рьяно включившись в прессинг."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f2594e14-be59-4a5b-a7a5-f74944293455",
                                "sense_id": "87b84582-55fa-331a-a7dd-fa7f541286a0",
                                "text": "«Уфа» же довольно активно огрызалась контратаками и также много фолила, в моменты когда «Краснодар» переходил от обороны в атаку."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "fcd6bda2-3444-4a27-baff-5ed4ca1a54a4",
                        "source_entry_id": "6837eea9-91fc-38af-a9b0-95dc911844e0",
                        "source_sense_id": "87b84582-55fa-331a-a7dd-fa7f541286a0",
                        "target_lang_word": "foul",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "foul",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7fbf2f00-ec70-3d79-8826-56e78ee4469b",
                                        "entry_id": "a461ddb8-e645-330d-88cc-baa957910849",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Covered with, or containing unclean matter; dirty."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "407b5163-d587-42dc-87a5-5754bd7986a4",
                                                "sense_id": "7fbf2f00-ec70-3d79-8826-56e78ee4469b",
                                                "text": "This cloth is too foul to use as a duster."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "440685f7-a9d1-4244-9bb5-1dbbe995727e",
                                                "sense_id": "7fbf2f00-ec70-3d79-8826-56e78ee4469b",
                                                "text": "His foul hands got dirt all over the kitchen."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f2f01018-cf79-4063-96a9-745796badc4c",
                                                "sense_id": "7fbf2f00-ec70-3d79-8826-56e78ee4469b",
                                                "text": "The air was so foul nobody could breathe."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7bdc0353-b339-4c67-bbce-e4c5882ecb27",
                                                "sense_id": "7fbf2f00-ec70-3d79-8826-56e78ee4469b",
                                                "text": "A ship's bottom is foul when overgrown with barnacles"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7c0e5817-30a2-4566-91f4-421f54fd3322",
                                                "sense_id": "7fbf2f00-ec70-3d79-8826-56e78ee4469b",
                                                "text": "A well is foul with polluted water."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f1ba246e-22a5-408b-ae1d-ec1195da20af",
                                                "sense_id": "7fbf2f00-ec70-3d79-8826-56e78ee4469b",
                                                "text": "It was, however, most interesting work, and the moulders themselves were a decent crowd, never tired of making jokes about themselves such as the hoary one that moulders did not live long, which however ran counter to the other one that no germs could live in a foundry—the atmosphere was too foul."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cfb94fb0-91e1-48ca-b52b-7da2fc6c9cf5",
                                                "sense_id": "7fbf2f00-ec70-3d79-8826-56e78ee4469b",
                                                "text": "Since the mid-1980s, when Indonesia first began to clear its bountiful forests on an industrial scale in favour of lucrative palm-oil plantations, “haze” has become an almost annual occurrence in South-East Asia. The cheapest way to clear logged woodland is to burn it, producing an acrid cloud of foul white smoke that, carried by the wind, can cover hundreds, or even thousands, of square miles."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f464cd88-2711-3538-8790-d1b4d33d5dd3",
                                        "entry_id": "a461ddb8-e645-330d-88cc-baa957910849",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Obscene, vulgar or abusive."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "of words or a way of speaking"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "32f59a16-effc-4eae-b531-5c5d738f6354",
                                                "sense_id": "f464cd88-2711-3538-8790-d1b4d33d5dd3",
                                                "text": "The rascal spewed forth a series of foul words."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "69b756ca-b76a-4f47-a4ac-30b8fc8b984b",
                                                "sense_id": "f464cd88-2711-3538-8790-d1b4d33d5dd3",
                                                "text": "His foul language causes many people to believe he is uneducated."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1d1ef24d-8174-3014-89c3-c31f228f05f3",
                                        "entry_id": "a461ddb8-e645-330d-88cc-baa957910849",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Detestable, unpleasant, loathsome."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fa145f79-e21b-4e36-8fca-f01b952e7342",
                                                "sense_id": "1d1ef24d-8174-3014-89c3-c31f228f05f3",
                                                "text": "He has a foul set of friends."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8b39e5c5-dab5-43d8-a5c9-5318d9d2defa",
                                                "sense_id": "1d1ef24d-8174-3014-89c3-c31f228f05f3",
                                                "text": "[…]Hast thou forgot / The foul witch Sycorax, who with age and envy / Was grown into a hoop? Hast thou forgot her?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9f27d5da-095d-43a0-871e-8abf853b6a25",
                                                "sense_id": "1d1ef24d-8174-3014-89c3-c31f228f05f3",
                                                "text": "Who first seduced them to that foul revolt?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3e36bbf8-9104-48b0-a31f-afc286f0eec0",
                                                "sense_id": "1d1ef24d-8174-3014-89c3-c31f228f05f3",
                                                "text": "Cultural norms and social rules regulate whether someone can be among others or will be isolated, whether the sick will be considered foul or acceptable, and whether they are to be pitied or censured."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e806d43f-03ea-3099-b30b-f2dad831c127",
                                        "entry_id": "a461ddb8-e645-330d-88cc-baa957910849",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Disgusting, repulsive; causing disgust."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4d49b63d-407c-47c7-8a78-49018e8d66dd",
                                                "sense_id": "e806d43f-03ea-3099-b30b-f2dad831c127",
                                                "text": "This foul food is making me retch."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c9e2e0d3-e38b-448e-bd42-0a6050c9aad7",
                                                "sense_id": "e806d43f-03ea-3099-b30b-f2dad831c127",
                                                "text": "There was a foul smell coming from the toilet."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "58fa19c7-9707-3e64-85db-f37dd0a407c9",
                                        "entry_id": "a461ddb8-e645-330d-88cc-baa957910849",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ugly; homely; poor."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6639d43e-0422-4ba1-90fe-88ecfdcf545a",
                                                "sense_id": "58fa19c7-9707-3e64-85db-f37dd0a407c9",
                                                "text": "Let us, like merchants, show our foulest wares."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b1cfeb69-d68c-3d37-8112-94ff7f230768",
                                        "entry_id": "a461ddb8-e645-330d-88cc-baa957910849",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Unpleasant, stormy or rainy. (of the weather)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bbe6b9d4-f83e-47dc-907d-7a33d8652ba5",
                                                "sense_id": "b1cfeb69-d68c-3d37-8112-94ff7f230768",
                                                "text": "Some foul weather is brewing."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4f7fbaa6-a01b-4e98-a399-e63841665c18",
                                                "sense_id": "b1cfeb69-d68c-3d37-8112-94ff7f230768",
                                                "text": "So foul a sky clears not without a storm."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fa0dad6a-4ef4-3b9a-b97a-b961493aefb1",
                                        "entry_id": "a461ddb8-e645-330d-88cc-baa957910849",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Dishonest or not conforming to the established rules and customs of a game, conflict, test, etc."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1c965d70-8f80-4c48-a83b-49099b795a66",
                                                "sense_id": "fa0dad6a-4ef4-3b9a-b97a-b961493aefb1",
                                                "text": "Foul play is not suspected."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bf5700a8-9277-3da6-b7ea-17cc76253b96",
                                        "entry_id": "a461ddb8-e645-330d-88cc-baa957910849",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Entangled and therefore restricting free movement, not clear."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e60759b4-07b7-460e-bc92-2b7e292f7437",
                                                "sense_id": "bf5700a8-9277-3da6-b7ea-17cc76253b96",
                                                "text": "We've got a foul anchor."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b23f1c55-fb58-492b-99a7-47baa6be771d",
                                                "sense_id": "bf5700a8-9277-3da6-b7ea-17cc76253b96",
                                                "text": "A rope could get foul while it is being paid out."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ce1c9334-78c8-3a21-8599-861f4d7ac885",
                                        "entry_id": "a461ddb8-e645-330d-88cc-baa957910849",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "(with \\\"of\\\") Positioned on, in, or near enough to (a specified area) so as to obstruct it."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2a4b4a07-c67d-4cbc-9a21-396caf7fa19f",
                                                "sense_id": "ce1c9334-78c8-3a21-8599-861f4d7ac885",
                                                "text": "The bus had stopped just foul of the north track at the Erindale Station Road public railway crossing […] With the bus stationary, but still foul of the north track, the train struck one of its front mirrors."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "40ff5493-a834-3ff1-beca-1dc17c1cc927",
                                        "entry_id": "a461ddb8-e645-330d-88cc-baa957910849",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Outside of the base lines; in foul territory."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9d3ef728-b4fc-4219-891d-c2e94cfb4234",
                                                "sense_id": "40ff5493-a834-3ff1-beca-1dc17c1cc927",
                                                "text": "Jones hit foul ball after foul ball."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "foul",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "334bcb35-571e-323a-a69f-5bb789760af2",
                                        "entry_id": "1d3b6708-1081-3dde-9982-c948cf227c9a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To make dirty."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b5d421d1-d6a1-4dc8-a593-c531977ad327",
                                                "sense_id": "334bcb35-571e-323a-a69f-5bb789760af2",
                                                "text": "to foul the face or hands with mire"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "15f2069c-de28-45a0-a7ed-06aa9b840e51",
                                                "sense_id": "334bcb35-571e-323a-a69f-5bb789760af2",
                                                "text": "She's fouled her diaper."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4c361865-30ac-375c-95fb-9d7f6a8b59ee",
                                        "entry_id": "1d3b6708-1081-3dde-9982-c948cf227c9a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To besmirch."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b7de5140-50d8-4747-807f-f03e9b6547ad",
                                                "sense_id": "4c361865-30ac-375c-95fb-9d7f6a8b59ee",
                                                "text": "He's fouled his reputation."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "54a9e475-3952-3965-ab01-126b65256c21",
                                        "entry_id": "1d3b6708-1081-3dde-9982-c948cf227c9a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To obstruct, block, or otherwise interfere with (something), for example by clogging (a drain, gun barrel, chimney, etc) or by being in the way of (a gunshot, etc)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2570e9b4-2e83-4aea-80a5-59669174d3f6",
                                                "sense_id": "54a9e475-3952-3965-ab01-126b65256c21",
                                                "text": "The hair has fouled the drain."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e4dbbecc-ed7e-428b-9398-671493b82e3e",
                                                "sense_id": "54a9e475-3952-3965-ab01-126b65256c21",
                                                "text": "As a result of the accident at Southend Airport when a Hermes aircraft overshot the runway and fouled the down Shenfield to Southend Victoria line between Rochford and Prittlewell, the Eastern Region is considering warning arrangements, which have already been provided on some lines running past aerodromes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "137fd4f5-884d-41f1-bfb6-14f704a84ee8",
                                                "sense_id": "54a9e475-3952-3965-ab01-126b65256c21",
                                                "text": "Unbelievable. Nearly all shots were fouled by twigs or branches."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e13f9d7c-c4ac-4bc3-a219-a2025c8011bf",
                                                "sense_id": "54a9e475-3952-3965-ab01-126b65256c21",
                                                "text": "Porterfields 5\" guns were of little use as their shots were fouled' by the other task group warships down range."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "161412db-fd44-4fb5-a219-672efb2d23e3",
                                                "sense_id": "54a9e475-3952-3965-ab01-126b65256c21",
                                                "text": "“You were lucky the shot was fouled,” said a dispassionate voice."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "53d02a21-d7df-3624-bf86-39e2f399af22",
                                        "entry_id": "1d3b6708-1081-3dde-9982-c948cf227c9a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To entangle."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d9d08b90-0de4-4dc6-98ef-4f9ee3e2a49c",
                                                "sense_id": "53d02a21-d7df-3624-bf86-39e2f399af22",
                                                "text": "The kelp has fouled the prop."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "25fe7661-2754-45e1-a619-d8f43ddea2a7",
                                                "sense_id": "53d02a21-d7df-3624-bf86-39e2f399af22",
                                                "text": "The Indian's heart was sore for his boat; it looked as if nothing could save her. She was drifting more slowly now, her propeller fouled in kelp."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "36c5643c-7547-3244-9277-000ef9a7d0fe",
                                        "entry_id": "1d3b6708-1081-3dde-9982-c948cf227c9a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To make contact with an opposing player in order to gain advantage."
